# Allow the principal below to trigger drm-colortemp's VT-switch helper without
# a password. Installed by cosmic-applet-colortemp.
#
# Only these three exact command lines are permitted: the helper accepts no
# other arguments, so this grants no general root access.
#
# Generated from this template by install.sh (a username, /usr/local/bin), the
# .deb (%sudo, /usr/bin) and the AUR PKGBUILDs (%wheel, /usr/bin). The two
# placeholder tokens are substituted at install/package time; keep them out of
# these comments so the substitution does not mangle the explanation.
@PRINCIPAL@ ALL=(root) NOPASSWD: @BINDIR@/drm-colortemp-apply auto, @BINDIR@/drm-colortemp-apply night, @BINDIR@/drm-colortemp-apply day
